WEBVTT

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:53.880
Chrono?

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:54.710
Yeah...

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:58.470
Here. This is from the man
who's with the Holy Woman.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.100
Rosette...

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.410
Roset...

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:33.090
Rosette, I saw the letter.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:37.470
What is it you want me to give back?

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.180
She means her time.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.470
Aion...

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:51.150
Give me back my life.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.980
In other words, cancel the contract.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.860
I want to save everyone.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:02.030
This is a fitting place for her to be released
from a devil's domain, don't you think?

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:05.160
Stop playing with our hearts!

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.160
Play? Me?

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:13.670
That hypocrite idly standing by
is the one who's playing.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.460
You're unfaithful too,Chrono.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.380
You're still not over
your feelings for Magdalene,

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:22.300
and yet this time,
it's Rosette Christopher?

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:25.890
No matter,
lust is also one of the great sins.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:29.230
Using one of the words you
all like, it would be love, I suppose.

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:32.100
If you love her, then why
have you come back to life?

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:37.190
Wouldn't it be better for
Rosette if you were dead?

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:43.110
If you live, then Rosette's life
will continue to be whittled away.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:47.410
I see, that's how much
you want to kill Rosette.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:52.370
You always end the life of
the woman you love with your own hand.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:55.710
Wouldn't it be better to change
your name to the God of Death?

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:58.130
Say whatever you want!

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.010
You won't give it back?

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.180
In that case, destroy him.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:29.240
What happened to
the woman you seduced earlier?

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.700
She was boring.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.960
It really is funny.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.630
People set their feet on the path
to destruction of their own will.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.090
It means that the time is right.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.420
Yeah...

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:44.260
They're corrupt,
so much so that it makes me shiver.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:47.010
Corruption is an aphrodisiac to us.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.390
The absence of God

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:52.310
has made Pandemonium
synonymous with the human world.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:55.850
People have become so that
they can only hear our voices now.

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.560
This is because they
know that lust and pleasure

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:01.820
open up more
wonderful doors than prayer.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.070
Heaven is pitiful, is it not?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.950
People have hearts,
and because they think,

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:10.530
now His light can't
reach the world of man.

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:12.450
But it can reach here.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.290
Pandemonium has already been
reduced to being Heaven's contractor.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.420
She's nothing more than a clown
whose purpose is to praise Heaven.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.210
Being a clown is a sad existence.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:27.890
They excite us and let us
sharpen our fangs and claws.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:30.640
We're going to make
the world of man a sacrifice.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.680
We will use the clown's head,

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:37.560
hold the one maiden that
is beloved by God in our arms,

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:40.190
and using the power of
the language of man and violence,

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:44.030
defile Heaven and make it
into Earth, and Earth into Heaven.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.860
That's...

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.320
In other words, freedom.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.200
Called sin, you see.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.370
Freedom...

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.330
We will conceal
the marks of being incomplete,

00:05:56.330 --> 00:06:00.460
and as truly
complete beings, recreate the world.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:25.990
Where's Rosette?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.130
This is horrible.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.340
They have the impudence to say that
the Magdalene Order is a band of heretics.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:51.640
That's malice they call justice.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.980
Thanks to Gilliam's connections,

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:00.770
we'll be guests here for two or three days.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:04.360
Sister Kate is trying to return to New York.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:09.400
Thinking about Rosette?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.530
At this rate, she's going to be a martyr.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.700
Joshua too.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:21.790
Hey, have you guys come
to see the Astral Line too?

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:25.590
It'll be soon. It's come really close.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.920
I wonder when my
big sister is going to come?

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.630
If we're going to explore it,
right now is our only chance.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.560
What's that?

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:49.360
Minister Remington picked
them up for me. They're my horns.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.240
What?

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:56.280
Satella, Fiore and
Mr. Steiner, I killed them all.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:59.830
Because I chose freedom.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:04.880
When Aion cut off Pandemonium's
head, I should have killed him.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.130
My weakness in not being able

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:10.800
to defy my desire for
freedom brought everything about.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.590
If I didn't exist...

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.060
Sister Kate...

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.480
Excuse me...

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:29.860
I thought so! You're the young
lady from the carnival, right?

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.280
It's been tough, hasn't it?

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:35.200
Even I was surprised that
that energetic girl was the Holy Woman.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.240
And you are?

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:41.500
Oh, excuse me.
I work for a local photography studio.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.420
When I inquired at
the Magdalene Order, it was in that state.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.880
I've been looking for you for a while now.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.170
The picture is ready, so...

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:56.140
There's also this.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:00.890
I caught a glimpse of the Holy
Woman in town and took a picture,

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.100
and I just had to have you see it.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.390
How horrible!

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:12.280
It'll probably take some
time until 'Cisco is rebuilt.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:16.320
But I'm going to continue to
take pictures of this town reviving.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:20.370
Right now,
what's going on in this country...

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:23.370
What kind of times we're living in...

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.670
I want to leave it behind to
tell those of the next generation.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.580
See you.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:29.920
Well...

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:32.800
Thank you very much for this!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.230
Sister Kate...

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.150
Where's Rosette?

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.940
She's vanished. We're back to square one.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.400
I see...

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.490
What's that?

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:01.700
It's a picture of Rosette
that a local cameraman took.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.080
This is completely...

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.080
It's conceivable that for Aion,

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.540
the disturbances in
'Cisco were just test cases.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.750
For the people who
have succumbed to despair,

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.710
Rosette's stigmata are
a greater hope than anything else.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.300
Aion is probably going
to use hope as a weapon,

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.470
and guide this country into chaos.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.970
What will await us after that happens?

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:28.770
The realization of the second
of the Prophecies of Fatima...

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.980
An even greater war will...

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:34.150
I believe we are being tested.

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:35.400
For what?!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:39.200
What is the Lord trying to make us do?!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.250
Why you!

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:21.700
In this one month,
there have in fact been

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.370
over two hundred
riots across the country.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.200
The police alone can not control them,

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:29.370
and there are even areas where
the National Guard has been mobilized.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.460
Furthermore, even the police are...

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:39.800
I can hear the noise.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.170
Noise?

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:43.720
He says that it's the voices of devils.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:44.800
Of devils?

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:50.270
Yes, that someone is
trying to trick him, and...

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:52.730
What are those wounds on your wrists?

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:54.650
They're in order to protect me.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:55.480
Why?

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:59.400
By cutting the same seals as
the Holy Woman into myself,

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:02.030
I can make the noise go away.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:06.370
But there are still guys
that make me hear the noise.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:09.580
I will kill them and become free.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.830
What is there for you
once you become free?

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.540
Did the Holy Woman say something?

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:19.710
That Heaven would become Earth,
and Earth would become Heaven.

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.170
Where can you see the Holy Woman?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:25.340
That is decided by the Holy Woman.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.390
We, the Crusaders, just do as she says.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:30.600
Crusaders?

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:33.190
Yes, the general term for
those people that imitate

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:36.230
the Holy Woman's stigmata
by cutting their own bodies

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.900
is Crusade, and the warriors
who have engraved the stigmata

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:42.610
into themselves are called Crusaders.

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:48.240
They're no different
from commonplace killers.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:53.040
They claim that what
they're doing is a battle for justice.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.330
Justice...

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.630
However, this is clearly nothing

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.790
but violence that has
overstepped the bounds.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:02.880
And at the center of
this is Sister Rosette, yes?

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.760
We still have not yet found her.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:22.530
The wounds won't heal.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:27.820
Is this the pain you
felt that I inflicted on you?

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.620
You won't give it back?

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:39.170
He's still alive.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:42.170
It looks like he wants
to kill you, no matter the cost.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.920
You will die, not having saved anyone.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.260
I refuse to accept that.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:50.470
I will take back my own life myself.

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.560
Bring him here one more time.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:54.100
Good girl...

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.330
Are regrets all you have?

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.250
Azmaria...

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:26.630
Even I have regrets,
that I wasn't able to do anything,

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:30.260
that even now,
Rosette is suffering by herself...

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.470
In that case, I

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:36.810
We're the same!
We both fought alongside Rosette.

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:40.270
Even about Miss Satella, I've thought,

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.860
"If only I had done that," and the like.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:47.490
We can't undo it anymore, but even still!

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:50.200
Our meeting each
other wasn't for nothing!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.910
Don't deny even the good things!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:57.830
Please don't make it so that
even the precious things didn't exist!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:01.880
You're the one that
gave me strength, Chrono.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.790
It's because the time I have is limited

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.880
that I have no time to have doubts.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.660
I was on the verge of running away again.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.370
Chrono...

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:38.500
Azmaria, I'm going to settle
my own matters myself too.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:41.710
This time I'm going to bring
Rosette back, no matter what!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:42.580
Chrono...

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.210
Well said!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.290
I've been waiting for those words!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.300
Elder...

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.380
I made this in preparation for this day.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.090
This is something that can mystically

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:56.760
and scientifically deduce
the whereabouts of a person

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.850
from the traces left
behind on something they used!

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.810
Now, hand me that gun!

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.480
Oh, yeah, sure.

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:07.270
What the? I haven't even started it yet.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.990
Rosette is calling.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:13.780
What?!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.780
Did he say what the location was?

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:19.790
Central Park, but he
said he was going alone.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:23.290
If he manipulates the mobs,
it will be a repeat of 'Cisco.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.960
We need to head there as well.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.470
Rosette...

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.350
What an inelegant tool.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:49.650
The Holy Woman said that she's
going to retrieve her life herself.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:55.320
I will be a spectator, just like Him.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:56.360
Rosette...

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:01.160
If that's what you want to do,
then go ahead and shoot.

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:04.330
If it's for you...
If it's so that you can live...

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.370
Then it's all right if I die.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:11.500
But before I die,
there's something that I just have to do.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:12.960
I have to settle things...

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.050
...with my own past!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:28.020
Chrono, why you!

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.810
Die and repent.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:31.570
Chrono...

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:48.330
Rosette!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:51.920
Chrono...

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.550
You know who I am, right?

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:57.130
Your heart has been
freed from Aion's spell.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.470
But the cost for that

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:01.640
was the final stigmata?

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.770
Chrono...

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.730
So these are your horns.

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:12.440
Chrono!

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:16.740
I'm sure that I said that I was going to
paint the other ending to the Apocalypse.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:20.160
Your power has already been surpassed!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.200
Chrono!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.830
Aion...

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.920
Chrono! Chrono!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:32.250
Chrono!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:38.550
Stop it, Rose...

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.640
I'll give it to you.

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:46.100
I'll give it all to you. So fight, Chrono.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:50.850
If my life can truly save a lot of people,

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.400
then it's all right if I die.

00:18:53.400 --> 00:19:02.120
Even if this is just God's plot
to restore the corrupt world...

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:06.790
I'm the one that will make the choice.

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:10.830
That is the greatest power.
That's why God granted us wisdom,

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:12.460
why He granted us hearts.

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:23.800
I understand now, Aion.

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.810
We need to be incomplete.

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:15.860
Chrono...

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:22.280
Rosette!

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.910
Chrono!

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:28.080
Rosette!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:30.830
Minister Remington...

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.710
This is all that was...

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:34.710
What of Rosette and Chrono?

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.840
So it's over.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:44.090
I...

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:46.300
I believe that somewhere, Rosette is alive.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.930
I'm sure of it.
